WEBVTT

00:02.544 --> 00:03.878
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:03.962 --> 00:05.505
Kids: Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：是的，是的，队长。

00:05.588 --> 00:07.173
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:07.257 --> 00:09.175
Kids:   Aye, aye,
Captain!
孩子们：是啊是啊
队长！

00:09.259 --> 00:11.678
Captain: ♪ Ohh... ♪
队长：♪ 哦...♪

00:11.761 --> 00:14.180
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:14.264 --> 00:16.015
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:16.099 --> 00:18.184
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:18.268 --> 00:19.894
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.978 --> 00:23.148
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:23.231 --> 00:24.774
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:24.858 --> 00:26.860
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:26.943 --> 00:28.069
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:28.153 --> 00:29.279
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:29.362 --> 00:31.030
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.114 --> 00:33.158
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.241 --> 00:34.701
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:34.784 --> 00:38.788
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:46.504 --> 00:49.007
Man: We take you now to
Encino, California.
男：我们现在带你去
加利福尼亚州恩西诺。

00:49.090 --> 00:52.051
Where we find the president of
the SpongeBob
SquarePants fan club...
我们在哪里找到总统
海绵宝宝
方裤粉丝俱乐部...

00:52.135 --> 00:55.722
Flipping burgers?
翻转汉堡？

00:57.140 --> 00:58.892
Oh, hey, kids.
哦，嘿，孩子们。

00:58.975 --> 01:02.896
Potty and I took jobs flipping
burgers so we can be just like
our hero
波蒂和我的工作翻转
汉堡，这样我们就可以像
我们的英雄

01:02.979 --> 01:04.773
SpongeBob SquarePants.
海绵宝宝。

01:04.856 --> 01:07.650
I took the job for
the free sodas.
我接受这份工作是为了
免费的苏打水。

01:07.734 --> 01:10.695
Potty, don't you
have dishes to wash?
便盆，你不是吗
有碗要洗吗？

01:10.779 --> 01:12.155
Argh...
啊啊……

01:12.238 --> 01:15.241
Ooh, hey, kids, say hello
to my boss, Mr. Pirateson.
哦，嘿，孩子们，打个招呼
给我的老板，海盗先生。

01:15.325 --> 01:16.618
Argh...
啊啊……

01:16.701 --> 01:20.789
One order of scurvy fries,
one large bilge water.
一份坏血病薯条，
一大堆舱底水。

01:20.872 --> 01:21.748
Argh...
啊啊……

01:21.831 --> 01:22.916
Argh...
啊啊……

01:22.999 --> 01:23.958
Diet bilge water.
饮食舱底水。

01:24.042 --> 01:25.001
Argh...
啊啊……

01:25.084 --> 01:28.755
I'll get right on it, sir.
我会马上处理的，先生。

01:28.838 --> 01:32.425
Ah...
啊...

01:32.509 --> 01:34.385
P.U., what died in here?
P.U.，这里死了什么？

01:34.469 --> 01:38.932
Oh, Potty, you're just in time
to try me new Pirate Patties.
哦，波蒂，你来得正是时候
来尝尝我新推出的海盗馅饼。

01:39.015 --> 01:40.016
I call this one
我称这个为

01:40.099 --> 01:41.351
"Buried Treasure".
“埋藏的宝藏”。

01:41.434 --> 01:43.895
Where'd you dig that one up?
你在哪里挖到这个的？

01:43.978 --> 01:44.896
This one's called
这个叫

01:44.979 --> 01:46.064
"Walk the Plank".
“走木板”。

01:46.147 --> 01:47.941
I'm already "bored"
with that one.
我已经“无聊”了
与那个。

01:48.024 --> 01:51.110
This one will blow that little
bird brain of yours.
这个会吹那么一点
你的鸟脑。

01:51.194 --> 01:53.238
Behold, the Patchy Patty.
看哪，帕奇·帕蒂。

01:53.321 --> 01:54.531
Ahoy.
哎呀。

01:54.614 --> 01:56.658
Oh, that's the worst
one yet  .
哦，这是最糟糕的
还没有一个。

01:56.741 --> 02:01.246
Potty Parrot, you are never
supportive of me.
便盆鹦鹉，你从来都不是
支持我。

02:01.329 --> 02:06.251
: I don't wanna
be your friend anymore.
: 我不想
不再是你的朋友了。

02:07.669 --> 02:10.004
: I never wanna
see you again.
: 我从来不想
再见。

02:10.088 --> 02:11.297
Patchy, no.
补丁，不。

02:15.802 --> 02:21.683
You know, this isn't the first
time that a Patty has come
between two good chums.
你知道，这不是第一次
帕蒂来的时间
两个好朋友之间。

02:21.766 --> 02:23.935
It happened once
in Bikini Bottom.
发生过一次
在比基尼底部。

02:24.018 --> 02:28.773
Here, take a look while
I pull myself together.
来来来，一会儿看一下
我振作起来。

02:45.498 --> 02:49.836
Hmm, something ain't right.
嗯，有些不对劲。

02:55.174 --> 02:56.509
For me?
为我？

02:56.593 --> 02:59.304
Don't you find this
a tad suspicious?
你没发现这个吗
有点可疑？

02:59.387 --> 03:03.057
Suspicion doesn't old a candle
to birthday wishing.
怀疑不会使蜡烛变老
到生日愿望。

03:04.100 --> 03:05.977
Surprise!
惊喜！

03:20.241 --> 03:21.117
Duck!
鸭子！

03:21.200 --> 03:26.956
Disengage.
脱离。

03:30.752 --> 03:34.130
Mr. Krabs: Me secret formula!
蟹老板：我的秘密配方！

03:34.213 --> 03:35.882
Plankton: Happy birthday, Krabs!
浮游生物：生日快乐，蟹蟹！

03:35.965 --> 03:40.219
Don't forget your
condiments, Plankton.
别忘了你的
调味品，浮游生物。

03:40.303 --> 03:46.392
That a boy, SpongeBob.
那是一个男孩，海绵宝宝。

03:46.476 --> 03:47.727
Safe!
安全的！

03:47.810 --> 03:51.272
You'll rue the day
we were born, Krabs.
你会后悔这一天
我们诞生了，蟹蟹。

03:51.356 --> 03:52.523
I'll be back.
我会回来的。

03:52.607 --> 03:55.902
Oh, barnacle.
哦，藤壶。

03:58.154 --> 04:00.365
All:
全部：

04:00.448 --> 04:02.158
Why, Mr. Krabs?
为什么，蟹老板？

04:02.241 --> 04:04.577
Why does he hate us so?
他为什么这么恨我们？

04:04.661 --> 04:08.081
Well, you might as well
blame me, SpongeBob.
嗯，你也可以
怪我吧，海绵宝宝。

04:08.164 --> 04:12.168
There was a time when
Plankton and I were...
曾经有一段时间
浮游生物和我...

04:12.251 --> 04:13.378
Best friends.
最好的朋友。

04:16.005 --> 04:17.340
Best friends?
最好的朋友？

04:17.423 --> 04:20.134
Friends at birth,
you might say.
出生时的朋友，
你可能会说。

04:20.218 --> 04:22.136
Even as wee ones...
即使是小孩子...

04:22.220 --> 04:23.429
Goo.
粘性物。

04:27.100 --> 04:30.395
Voices: Aw...
声音：啊……

04:32.689 --> 04:35.608
Mr. Krabs: Things were all
peaches and cream.
蟹老板：一切都过去了
桃子和奶油。

04:35.692 --> 04:37.819
Voices: Aw...
声音：啊……

04:37.902 --> 04:40.029
Mr. Krabs: Until we hit
grade school.
蟹老板：直到我们击中
小学。

04:44.409 --> 04:45.827
Hey, Planky, what you doing?
嘿，普朗基，你在做什么？

04:45.910 --> 04:49.956
Oh, just a little something I
thought I'd try out.
哦，只是一点点我
我想我会尝试一下。

04:50.039 --> 04:52.458
Kids:
孩子们：

04:52.542 --> 04:53.626
Idiots!
白痴！

04:53.710 --> 04:56.295
I'll show you with science!
我用科学告诉你！

04:56.379 --> 05:00.174
This concoction's gonna blow
everyone away.
这混合物会爆炸
大家都走开。

05:02.218 --> 05:05.888
Kids:
孩子们：

05:08.224 --> 05:14.981
how's this for a science
experiment, Mr.
Brain-A-Tron 5000?
这是一门科学吗？
实验，先生
Brain-A-Tron 5000？

05:16.858 --> 05:21.320
Oh, they'll pay for
this one day, Eugene.
哦，他们会付出代价的
这一天，尤金。

05:21.404 --> 05:23.031
Darn tootin'.
该死的。

05:23.114 --> 05:28.161
Hey, barnacle brains, I think
you owe Plankton an apology.
嘿，藤壶脑，我想
你欠浮游生物一个道歉。

05:28.244 --> 05:30.913
You're right, Plankton,
I'm sorry.
你说得对，浮游生物，
对不起。

05:30.997 --> 05:34.625
Sorry you have to hang
out with rag boy.
抱歉你必须挂了
和破布男孩出去了。

05:34.709 --> 05:36.878
All:
全部：

05:36.961 --> 05:40.506
yeah, where'd you do your
clothes shopping, the trash can?
是的，你在哪里做你的
买衣服、扔垃圾桶？

05:40.590 --> 05:42.091
All:
全部：

05:42.175 --> 05:45.803
Mr. Krabs: 'Twas true, I did get
me clothes from the trash.
蟹老板：“这是真的，我确实得到了
我的衣服是从垃圾桶里捡来的。

05:45.887 --> 05:49.682
You see, when I was growing up,
times were tough.
你看，在我成长的过程中，
日子很艰难。

05:49.766 --> 05:54.604
Me mother had to fashion me
clothes from rags.
我妈妈必须塑造我
破布做的衣服。

05:58.107 --> 06:00.359
There you go, Son, you're
outfit's all finished.
就这样吧，儿子，你就是
服装全部完成了

06:00.443 --> 06:05.031
It's a good thing old man
Jenkins was kind enough to spare
his last washcloth.
老头真是好事
詹金斯很友善地饶恕了
他的最后一块毛巾。

06:05.114 --> 06:06.157
Oops...
哎呀...

06:06.240 --> 06:08.159
I missed a spot.
我错过了一个地方。

06:08.242 --> 06:12.371
Mr. Krabs: Then one day
while Plankton and I plotted
our revenge
蟹老板：然后有一天
当浮游生物和我密谋时
我们的复仇

06:12.455 --> 06:13.831
I met the love of me life.
我遇到了我一生的挚爱。

06:13.915 --> 06:17.210
What in Neptune's net is that?
海王星的网里是什么？

06:19.087 --> 06:24.550
It's the most beautiful thing me
eyes have ever seen.
这是我最美的事
眼睛曾经见过。

06:24.634 --> 06:25.551
What is it?
它是什么？

06:25.635 --> 06:26.552
It's money.
这是钱。

06:26.636 --> 06:29.430
Money?
钱？

06:29.514 --> 06:32.308
Yeah, you can buy things
with it.
是啊，可以买东西
与它。

06:32.391 --> 06:35.269
Buy things?
买东西？

06:35.353 --> 06:39.398
So I spent it on a gift for me
best pal, Plankton.
所以我把它花在了给我的礼物上
最好的朋友，浮游生物。

06:41.150 --> 06:46.322
Ah...!
啊...！

06:46.405 --> 06:48.950
All: Wow...
全体：哇……

06:49.033 --> 06:50.868
Got your secret recipe,
Mr. Krabs.
得到了你的秘方，
蟹老板。

06:50.952 --> 06:53.871
You have no idea what that went
through to get here.
你不知道发生了什么
通过到达这里。

06:53.955 --> 06:55.581
I've got a pretty good idea.
我有一个很好的主意。

06:55.665 --> 06:58.626
So if you guys were such great
friends, what happened?
所以如果你们都这么棒的话
朋友们，发生什么事了？

06:58.709 --> 07:02.296
Yeah, Mr. Krabs,
what did happen next?
是的，蟹老板先生，
接下来发生了什么？

07:02.380 --> 07:04.507
Yeah, I really wanna know.
是的，我真的很想知道。

07:04.590 --> 07:08.469
Listen up, Squidward, 'cause
this is where it gets juicy.
听着，章鱼哥，因为
这就是它变得多汁的地方。

07:08.553 --> 07:10.555
It all began in
a place called...
这一切都开始于
一个叫...的地方

07:10.638 --> 07:11.931
Stinky Burgers.
臭汉堡。

07:12.014 --> 07:14.350
It was the only place
to get a burger.
这是唯一的地方
去买一个汉堡。

07:14.433 --> 07:16.727
The kids loved Stinky.
孩子们很喜欢臭臭。

07:16.811 --> 07:21.274
All: Stinky, Stinky...!
全体：臭臭臭……！

07:23.568 --> 07:24.777
Mr. Krabs: And Stinky
loved the kids.
蟹老板：还有臭味
喜欢孩子们。

07:24.861 --> 07:26.821
What can I do
for you, young'uns?
我能做什么
对于你来说，年轻人？

07:26.904 --> 07:29.282
Mr. Stinky, I'll have
one burger please.
臭先生，我会的
请来一个汉堡。

07:29.365 --> 07:30.700
Me too, Stinky.
我也是，臭臭。

07:30.783 --> 07:34.328
Now, now, kids, there's plenty
of burgers for everyone.
现在，现在，孩子们，有很多
适合每个人的汉堡。

07:36.372 --> 07:40.042
That's why we like you so much,
Stinky, you always deliver
the goods.
这就是为什么我们如此喜欢你
臭臭的，你总是送东西
货物。

07:40.126 --> 07:42.920
We don't like Stinky,
we respect him.
我们不喜欢臭味，
我们尊重他。

07:43.004 --> 07:45.590
Well, which one is it, kids?
那么，孩子们，这是哪一个呢？

07:45.673 --> 07:47.550
Do you like or respect me?
你喜欢我还是尊重我？

07:47.633 --> 07:48.509
Like.
喜欢。

07:48.593 --> 07:49.468
Respect.
尊重。

07:49.552 --> 07:50.469
Like!
喜欢！

07:50.553 --> 07:52.138
Respect!
尊重！

07:52.221 --> 07:55.641
O.K., let's just meet in the
middle and say you li-spect me.
好吧，我们就在
中间并说你尊重我。

07:59.395 --> 08:00.646
Mr. Krabs: Excuse us.
蟹老板：对不起。

08:00.730 --> 08:03.733
Plankton: Valuable customers
coming through.
Plankton：有价值的客户
通过。

08:03.816 --> 08:05.526
What are those dorks doing here?
那些呆子在这里做什么？

08:05.610 --> 08:07.820
Two stinky burgers, please.
请给我两个臭汉堡。

08:07.904 --> 08:12.783
Did your brains dribble out
onto the sidewalk you slept
on last night?
你的脑子有没有流出来
到你睡过的人行道上
昨晚？

08:12.867 --> 08:16.287
If it's burgers you want,
go around back.
如果你想要汉堡
绕回去。

08:16.370 --> 08:18.164
Kids: Yeah, stinky!
孩子们：是啊，臭！

08:18.247 --> 08:20.666
Thanks for keeping
the nerds out.
感谢您的保留
书呆子们出去了。

08:20.750 --> 08:22.501
You're the best, Stinky.
你是最棒的，臭臭。

08:22.585 --> 08:24.837
O.K., that's enough, kids.
好吧，够了，孩子们。

08:24.921 --> 08:26.839
Gather 'round, children.
聚集起来，孩子们。

08:26.923 --> 08:28.090
There's something
I wanna tell you.
有东西
我想告诉你。

08:28.174 --> 08:30.009
What I have to say
is very important.
我要说的话
非常重要。

08:30.092 --> 08:36.933
If you remember just one thing
for the rest of your life,
remember that...
如果你只记得一件事
在你的余生中，
请记住...

08:37.016 --> 08:41.687
Without your kind patronage,
I'd be a penniless loser
like rag boy.
没有您的善意惠顾，
我会是一个身无分文的失败者
就像破布男孩一样。

08:46.984 --> 08:48.778
do you two have kelp for brains?
你们两个脑子里有海带吗？

08:48.861 --> 08:50.947
Don't you understand?
你不明白吗？

08:51.030 --> 08:55.701
If you two yahoos keep coming
around, you'll drive away all
the normal customers.
如果你们两个雅虎继续来
周围，你会赶走一切
普通顾客。

08:55.785 --> 09:01.499
I've worked too long and
too hard to make this a
li-spectable business.
我已经工作了太久并且
太难了
值得尊敬的生意。

09:01.582 --> 09:04.669
As it is, I can barely afford
the essential things in life.
事实上，我几乎买不起
生活中必不可少的东西。

09:05.795 --> 09:10.925
is it quitting time already?
已经到下班时间了吗？

09:11.008 --> 09:17.056
Now if you'll excuse me,
I'm off to enjoy some of
life's essentials.
现在请原谅我
我要去享受一些
生活必需品。

09:17.807 --> 09:22.228
Ooh...!
噢...！

09:23.062 --> 09:24.897
Did you hear that, Krabs?
你听到了吗，蟹蟹？

09:24.981 --> 09:29.735
By cooking burgers for those
cretins, he was able to gain
their li-spect.
通过为那些人烹饪汉堡
白痴，他能够获得
他们的观点。

09:29.819 --> 09:31.737
Did you see that fat
stack of loot?
你看到那个胖子了吗
一堆战利品？

09:31.821 --> 09:36.659
I bet if someone made a better
burger, they'd have a fatter
stack of loot.
我打赌如果有人做得更好
汉堡，他们会更胖
一堆战利品。

09:38.160 --> 09:41.664
But who has the ability
to make such a burger?
但谁有能力
做这样的汉堡？

09:41.747 --> 09:43.082
Who has the skill?
谁有这个技能？

09:43.165 --> 09:45.668
Skill Schmill, Krabs baby.
技能施米尔，蟹宝宝。

09:45.751 --> 09:48.879
Who needs skill when science is
on your side?
当科学盛行时谁需要技能
在你这边吗？

09:48.963 --> 09:51.424
Plankton: We'll make that
burger, and when we do
浮游生物：我们会做到的
汉堡，当我们这样做时

09:51.507 --> 09:53.843
we will rule the school!
我们将统治学校！

09:58.306 --> 10:00.016
: I miss Potty.
: 我想念波蒂。

10:00.099 --> 10:04.729
I remember
the first time we met.
我记得
我们第一次见面。

10:04.812 --> 10:06.897
If I could only hear his voice.
如果我能听到他的声音就好了。

10:06.981 --> 10:08.607
Less talking and
more working, Jack.
少说话和
更多工作，杰克。

10:08.691 --> 10:10.443
Potty?
便壶？

10:10.526 --> 10:12.111
You came back to apologize.
你回来道歉了。

10:12.194 --> 10:14.447
I came to tell you
to get back to work.
我是来告诉你的
回去工作。

10:14.530 --> 10:18.617
You can't tell me
what to do, you...
你不能告诉我
该怎么办，你...

10:18.701 --> 10:20.286
Patchy: Assistant manager?
帕奇：助理经理？

10:20.369 --> 10:22.955
How did you get to be
assistant manager?
你是怎么变成这样的
经理助理？

10:23.039 --> 10:25.916
A little thing called
a G.E.D., my man.
有一个小东西叫
一个 G.E.D.，我的朋友。

10:26.000 --> 10:28.461
Oh, here we go with the
fancy book learning.
哦，我们来吧
奇特的书本学习。

10:28.544 --> 10:30.838
Customers love me cooking.
顾客喜欢我做饭。

10:30.921 --> 10:32.673
Why, we're almost out
of doggy bags.
为什么，我们快要出去了
的狗袋。

10:35.885 --> 10:40.014
oh, Potty, what am I
doing wrong?
哦，Potty，我是什么？
做错了吗？

10:40.097 --> 10:44.352
You just need some
practice is all.
你只需要一些
练习就是全部。

11:04.997 --> 11:07.083
Ooh, me patty's done.
哦，我的帕蒂已经完成了。

11:07.166 --> 11:08.876
Smells like an unswabbed
poop deck.
闻起来像未擦拭过的
船尾甲板。

11:08.959 --> 11:11.587
Oh, fine, I'll try it then.
哦，好吧，那我就试试吧。

11:16.217 --> 11:17.718
Ah...!
啊...！

11:17.802 --> 11:23.766
For the crime of befouling me
taste buds, I order you to...
犯了污蔑我的罪
味蕾，我命令你……

11:23.849 --> 11:28.729
Walk the plank!
走木板！

11:28.813 --> 11:30.648
Ah...
啊...

11:30.731 --> 11:34.026
Oh, well, I bet SpongeBob's
first Patty didn't go
so well either.
哦，好吧，我打赌海绵宝宝
首先帕蒂没有去
也很好。

11:34.110 --> 11:37.697
Roll film.
胶卷。

11:45.913 --> 11:49.542
A perfect Patty
on the first try.
完美的帕蒂
第一次尝试。

11:49.625 --> 11:50.709
Oh...
哦...

11:50.793 --> 11:52.837
I'll make a potty
Patty out of you.
我会做一个便盆
帕蒂离开你。

11:52.920 --> 11:54.880
You're unsanitary, Patchy.
你不讲卫生，帕奇。

11:54.964 --> 11:56.382
You keep hamburger
meat in an old boot.
你留着汉堡
旧靴子里的肉。

11:56.465 --> 11:59.260
Well, that's what gives
it it's special flavor.
好吧，这就是给
它的味道很特别。

11:59.343 --> 12:01.011
Potty: You've got rats
in the kitchen.
便盆：你有老鼠
在厨房里。

12:01.095 --> 12:04.765
Oh, I brush and
shampoo them daily.
哦，我刷了
每天给他们洗头。

12:04.849 --> 12:07.017
Who's Patchy's little Princess?
帕奇的小公主是谁？

12:08.310 --> 12:09.061
Ow!
噢！

12:09.145 --> 12:10.062
Oh, mmm...
哦，嗯……

12:10.146 --> 12:11.605
Don't do that.
不要那样做。

12:11.689 --> 12:14.275
And you should wash your hands
after using the bathroom.
你应该洗手
使用浴室后。

12:14.358 --> 12:15.067
What?
什么？

12:15.151 --> 12:16.819
Every time?
每次？

12:16.902 --> 12:18.154
That's not all.
这还不是全部。

12:18.237 --> 12:20.072
This is a step in
the right direction.
这是一个步骤
正确的方向。

12:20.156 --> 12:22.241
What kind of a pirate
wears a hairnet?
什么样的海盗
戴发网吗？

12:22.324 --> 12:25.411
The same kind that wears a "kiss
the cook" apron.
戴“吻”的同款
厨师”围裙。

12:25.494 --> 12:28.247
Well, you never know, Potty,
I might get lucky.
好吧，你永远不知道，Potty，
我可能会幸运。

12:28.330 --> 12:32.585
You hear that, ladies,
Patchy is available.
你们听到了，女士们，
补丁可用。

12:32.668 --> 12:33.586
Now I feel sick.
现在我感觉不舒服。

12:33.669 --> 12:35.880
That's it, you feathered snake.
就是这样，你这只长着羽毛的蛇。

12:35.963 --> 12:38.716
This time you've gone too far.
这次你太过分了。

12:39.800 --> 12:40.718
Patty: You missed.
帕蒂：你错过了。

12:41.802 --> 12:46.682
is that all you've got?
这就是你所拥有的一切吗？

12:46.765 --> 12:48.058
Now you've done it.
现在你已经做到了。

12:48.142 --> 12:49.560
Argh...
啊啊……

12:49.643 --> 12:50.519
Argh...
啊啊……

12:50.603 --> 12:52.813
Yes, Mr. Pirateson.
是的，海盗先生。

12:52.897 --> 12:58.611
You kids watch the rest of
the cartoon, while I watch
Potty get fired.
你们孩子们看剩下的
当我看漫画的时候
波蒂被解雇了。

12:58.694 --> 13:00.237
Mr. Pirateson: Argh...
海盗先生：啊……

13:00.321 --> 13:03.824
Coming, Mr. Pirateson, sir.
来了，海盗先生，先生。

13:03.908 --> 13:07.369
Mr. Krabs: So we went back to
our secret hideaway...
蟹老板：所以我们回到了
我们的秘密藏身处...

13:07.453 --> 13:09.205
The dump.
垃圾场。

13:09.288 --> 13:12.291
To prove to those chowder heads
that a burger could be
semi-edible
向那些杂烩头证明
汉堡可以是
半食用的

13:12.374 --> 13:14.335
and easy to swallow.
且易于吞咽。

13:14.418 --> 13:18.005
We made sure to keep careful
record of our progress.
我们一定要小心
记录我们的进步。

13:28.182 --> 13:29.600
Plankton: Gently.
浮游生物：轻轻地。

13:29.683 --> 13:31.560
Gently.
轻轻地。

13:31.644 --> 13:36.190
Mr. Krabs: We finally emerged
with the best-looking
burger under the sea.
蟹老板：我们终于出现了
与最好看的
汉堡在海底。

13:36.273 --> 13:40.319
We went back to Stinky's
to rub our Patty in those
kids' greasy faces.
我们又回到了臭臭店
把我们的帕蒂擦在那些身上
孩子们油腻的脸。

13:40.402 --> 13:44.323
But Stinky's had been
shut down by order of
the health department.
但臭臭的已经
按以下命令关闭
卫生部门。

13:44.406 --> 13:51.664
So we seized the opportunity,
and converted our hangout
to a restaurant.
于是我们抓住了这个机会，
并转换了我们的环聊
到一家餐馆。

13:53.457 --> 13:56.877
Pur venture into
capitalism began.
追求冒险
资本主义开始了。

13:56.961 --> 13:58.254
$1, please.
1 美元，请。

13:58.337 --> 14:00.506
There you are, sir.
就在这儿，先生。

14:00.589 --> 14:02.675
Mr. Krabs: 'Twas me first
dollar I'd ever earned.
蟹老板：“首先是我
我赚过的美元。

14:02.758 --> 14:08.180
And 'twas also the beginning
of a beautiful romantic
relationship with money.
这也是开始
一个美丽浪漫的
与金钱的关系。

14:08.264 --> 14:09.723
Kid: Hey...
孩子：嘿……

14:09.807 --> 14:13.227
You're burgers are even
worse than Stinky's.
你的汉堡很均匀
比臭臭的还要糟糕。

14:13.310 --> 14:15.104
We can barely keep 'em down.
我们几乎无法阻止他们。

14:15.187 --> 14:18.857
If it weren't for Stinky's
shuttin' down, no one
would eat here.
如果不是臭臭
关门了，没有人
会在这里吃饭。

14:18.941 --> 14:20.025
Now give me a burger.
现在给我一个汉堡。

14:20.109 --> 14:21.026
I'm starving.
我饿死了。

14:21.110 --> 14:23.529
Just look at them, Eugene.
看看他们，尤金。

14:23.612 --> 14:28.492
Plankton: The very people who
ridiculed me are now feasting
on my recipe.
浮游生物：正是那些
嘲笑我现在正在吃喝玩乐
在我的食谱上。

14:28.576 --> 14:31.078
I thought it was our recipe.
我以为这是我们的食谱。

14:31.161 --> 14:33.497
I'm ruling their stomachs.
我在统治他们的胃。

14:33.581 --> 14:36.709
And soon, I will be
ruling their minds.
很快，我就会
统治他们的思想。

14:38.836 --> 14:41.964
But what about satisfying
the customer?
但满足又怎样
客户？

14:42.047 --> 14:43.382
Barnacles to the customer.
藤壶给顾客。

14:43.465 --> 14:45.968
I'm talking about
ruling the world!
我说的是
统治世界！

14:47.553 --> 14:51.515
And with this secret recipe,
nothing will stop me.
有了这个秘方，
没有什么能阻止我。

14:51.599 --> 14:52.433
Give me that.
给我那个。

14:52.516 --> 14:56.645
Stop, you're gonna bust it.
停下来，你会毁了它。

14:56.729 --> 14:59.315
Burgers aren't for
ruling worlds.
汉堡不适合
统治世界。

14:59.398 --> 15:02.401
I'm terribly sorry, Eugene,
I couldn't hear you.
我非常抱歉 尤金
我听不见你说话。

15:02.484 --> 15:04.236
Could you come closer?
你能靠近点吗？

15:04.320 --> 15:06.488
Maybe stand on the tile
in front of you.
也许站在瓷砖上
在你面前。

15:06.572 --> 15:07.323
Which one?
哪一个？

15:07.406 --> 15:08.532
The one that says "eject"
那个写着“弹出”的

15:08.616 --> 15:10.242
or the one that says
"trap door"?
或者那个说
“活板门”？

15:10.326 --> 15:11.952
Oh, either one will do.
哦，任何一个都可以。

15:12.036 --> 15:14.538
What I was saying was...
我想说的是...

15:14.622 --> 15:19.168
You'll regret this one day.
有一天你会后悔的。

15:19.251 --> 15:21.754
And he always did.
他总是这样做。

15:21.837 --> 15:22.713
Lies!
谎言！

15:23.756 --> 15:25.007
Hold on there, me boy.
坚持住，我的孩子。

15:25.090 --> 15:26.717
We don't need to go
through all that again.
我们不需要去
再次经历这一切。

15:26.800 --> 15:30.262
Very touching,
but completely false.
非常感人，
但完全错误。

15:30.346 --> 15:31.472
Don't know what you mean.
不知道你的意思。

15:31.555 --> 15:33.557
Why don't you tell
them the truth?
你为什么不告诉
他们说的是实话吗？

15:33.641 --> 15:36.644
It  did  happen that way
didn't it Mr. Krabs?
事情确实是这样发生的
不是蟹老板吗？

15:36.727 --> 15:40.481
Most of it is true, except for
what  really  happened.
大部分都是真的，除了
到底发生了什么。

15:40.564 --> 15:44.026
We had created
the tastiest burger.
我们创造了
最美味的汉堡。

15:44.109 --> 15:48.155
That's when things
became unsavory.
这时候事情
变得令人厌恶。

15:51.617 --> 15:55.120
First, we rule their
stomachs, and then...
首先，我们统治他们
肚子，然后……

15:55.204 --> 15:57.998
their money.
他们的钱。

15:59.875 --> 16:01.919
But what about satisfying
the customers?
但满足又怎样
客户？

16:02.002 --> 16:03.128
Barnacles to the customers.
藤壶给顾客。

16:04.797 --> 16:08.801
I'm talking about coins, cash,
wallets, bank accounts.
我说的是硬币、现金
钱包、银行账户。

16:08.884 --> 16:13.639
And with this secret recipe,
nothing will stop me!
有了这个秘方，
没有什么能阻止我！

16:13.722 --> 16:14.556
Give me that.
给我那个。

16:14.640 --> 16:17.434
Stop, you're gonna bust it.
停下来，你会毁了它。

16:17.518 --> 16:20.938
This isn't about money, Eugene.
这不是钱的问题，尤金。

16:21.021 --> 16:24.566
Malarkey.
说大话。

16:24.650 --> 16:27.861
You'll regret this one day!
有一天你会后悔的！

16:27.945 --> 16:28.904
Ouch.
哎哟。

16:28.987 --> 16:30.823
Huh?
啊？

16:30.906 --> 16:34.368
Our little squabble only got me
part of the recipe.
我们的小争吵只伤害了我
食谱的一部分。

16:34.451 --> 16:36.495
SpongeBob: Gosh, Mr. Plankton
海绵宝宝：天啊，浮游生物先生

16:36.578 --> 16:39.623
That doesn't sound like the
Mr. Krabs story at all.
这听起来不像
蟹老板的故事根本就没有。

16:39.707 --> 16:42.835
Voice: That's because it isn't.
声音：那是因为事实并非如此。

16:42.918 --> 16:43.877
All: Karen?
全体：凯伦？

16:43.961 --> 16:45.087
Karen: You're both liars.
凯伦：你们都是骗子。

16:45.170 --> 16:46.880
That's not how it
happened at all.
事情不是这样的
发生了。

16:46.964 --> 16:51.427
In those days, I was just
starting out as a
security system.
那些日子里，我只是
开始作为
安全系统。

16:51.510 --> 16:53.429
Plankton and I met when he
installed me.
Plankton 和我是在他认识的时候认识的
安装了我。

16:53.512 --> 16:55.180
It was only our third date.
这只是我们的第三次约会。

16:55.264 --> 16:58.767
Karen: Anyways, I recorded the
whole thing in my databanks.
凯伦：不管怎样，我录了
整个事情都在我的数据库中。

17:00.102 --> 17:02.896
Now that's a handsome
looking burger.
现在是个帅哥
寻找汉堡。

17:02.980 --> 17:05.190
You said it, old chum.
你说的是吧，老朋友。

17:05.274 --> 17:10.612
Mr. Krabs: Attention,
get your Plankton and
Krabs Patties right here.
蟹老板：注意，
得到你的浮游生物和
蟹肉饼就在这里。

17:10.696 --> 17:13.699
You think it was a good
idea to open a in a dump?
你认为这是一个好的
想在垃圾场开一个吗？

17:16.118 --> 17:17.327
What's that music?
那是什么音乐？

17:17.411 --> 17:19.872
I'd know that theme
song anywhere.
我就知道这个主题
任何地方的歌曲。

17:19.955 --> 17:22.082
It's old man Jenkins.
这是老詹金斯。

17:22.166 --> 17:23.959
Mr. Krabs: Old man Jenkins?
蟹老板：老詹金斯？

17:24.042 --> 17:27.713
I've just been searching for
some new shoes for old Bessie.
我刚刚一直在寻找
给老贝西一些新鞋。

17:27.796 --> 17:30.549
You helped me mom and me
through some tough times.
你帮助了我妈妈和我
度过一些艰难的时期。

17:30.632 --> 17:35.429
It would be an honor if you'd
be the first to try our
delicious burgers.
如果您愿意，那将是我的荣幸
成为第一个尝试我们的
美味的汉堡。

17:35.512 --> 17:37.306
Why, I'd be happy to.
为什么，我很乐意。

17:44.772 --> 17:47.983
Yeah!
是的！

17:49.318 --> 17:52.446
Mr. Krabs: "Plab Patty's
K.O. Old Man J."
蟹老板：“Plab Patty’s
K.O. J老头。”

17:52.529 --> 17:55.949
I can't believe we poisoned
that sweet old guy.
我不敢相信我们中毒了
那个可爱的老家伙。

17:56.033 --> 17:57.367
Well, he is old.
嗯，他老了。

17:57.451 --> 18:00.287
Hey, that guy's like
family to me.
嘿，那家伙就像
家人对我来说。

18:00.370 --> 18:02.581
Well, it was your fault
the patty was tainted.
好吧，这是你的错
肉饼被污染了。

18:02.664 --> 18:05.417
You're the one who put too much
seaweed sauce in the burger.
你是那个投入太多的人
汉堡里的海藻酱。

18:05.501 --> 18:07.127
You let it sit out too long.
你让它放置太久了。

18:07.211 --> 18:08.420
That's what did it.
就是这么做的。

18:08.504 --> 18:10.506
I'm taking the recipe
and fixing it.
我拿着菜谱
并修复它。

18:10.589 --> 18:13.258
No way, that recipe's mine.
不可能，那个食谱是我的。

18:13.342 --> 18:18.597
Stop, you're gonna...
停下来，你会...

18:18.680 --> 18:28.190
You wanna fight over this
recipe, I'll give you a fight
you'll never forget.
你想为此而战
菜谱，我要给你打架
你永远不会忘记。

18:28.273 --> 18:29.650
Well, that's ruined.
嗯，那就毁了。

18:29.733 --> 18:32.110
But no use letting
this go to waste.
但让也没有用
这就浪费了。

18:32.194 --> 18:34.238
These kids'll eat anything.
这些孩子什么都吃。

18:36.365 --> 18:37.616
I've done it.
我已经做到了。

18:37.699 --> 18:41.036
I've discovered the
perfect patty batter.
我发现了
完美的肉饼面糊。

18:41.119 --> 18:45.457
Karen: Meanwhile, Plankton was
back at the elementary school.
凯伦：与此同时，浮游生物
回到小学。

18:45.541 --> 18:49.253
But this time he was
going it alone.
但这一次他是
独自前行。

18:49.336 --> 18:50.754
Oh, no you don't.
哦，不，你不知道。

18:50.838 --> 18:52.256
This is my turf.
这是我的地盘。

18:52.339 --> 18:54.299
I think not, rag boy.
我想不是，破布男孩。

18:54.383 --> 18:55.801
What?
什么？

18:55.884 --> 18:58.804
Why I ought to squash you
right now, you little...
为什么我应该压扁你
现在，你这个小...

18:58.887 --> 19:00.013
Get out of my face.
从我面前滚出去。

19:00.097 --> 19:01.431
Both:
两个都：

19:01.515 --> 19:03.892
Hey, look, nerd fight.
嘿，看，书呆子打架。

19:03.976 --> 19:05.185
I got $5 on rag boy.
我在 rag boy 上得到了 5 美元。

19:05.269 --> 19:06.603
Ah-hah!
啊哈！

19:06.687 --> 19:10.607
We'll let the customers decide
who's burger's better.
我们会让客户决定
谁的汉堡更好。

19:10.691 --> 19:12.776
Step right up, gents.
先生们，请站起来。

19:12.860 --> 19:15.571
Get a delicious Chum Burger
right here.
获得美味的 Chum 汉堡
就在这里。

19:15.654 --> 19:18.448
Big Johnny will eat anything.
大约翰尼什么都吃。

19:18.532 --> 19:20.868
Have a Chum Burger, Johnny sir.
约翰尼先生，来一份密姆汉堡吧。

19:22.995 --> 19:27.833
Karen: Plankton had pieced
together his own creation using
memory and science.
凯伦：浮游生物已经拼凑起来
结合他自己的创作
记忆和科学。

19:27.916 --> 19:33.463
Go on, sir, tell your buddies
what you think.
先生，快去告诉你的朋友吧
你怎么想。

19:33.547 --> 19:37.009
I'm gonna try one of
rag boy's burgers.
我要尝试其中之一
破布男孩的汉堡。

19:37.092 --> 19:38.677
Here you are, sir.
在这里，先生。

19:38.760 --> 19:43.140
You are the first to taste
Krabby Patty.
你是第一个品尝的
克拉比·帕蒂。

19:45.434 --> 19:47.060
Flavor!
味道！

19:48.145 --> 19:49.187
Edible!
食用！

19:49.271 --> 19:51.231
We can actually hold it down.
其实我们可以把它压住。

19:51.315 --> 19:53.650
This is the most
"flavortastic" sensation
这是最
“美味”的感觉

19:53.734 --> 19:56.987
my still-developing taste buds
have ever experienced!
我仍在发育的味蕾
曾经经历过！

20:00.657 --> 20:02.701
I'll show you, Krabs.
我会告诉你，蟹蟹。

20:02.784 --> 20:06.204
I'll steal that cursed recipe
from you one day.
我会偷走那个被诅咒的食谱
有一天从你那里。

20:06.288 --> 20:08.040
And I won't stop till I do.
在我这样做之前我不会停止。

20:08.123 --> 20:09.041
Whoo hoo!
呼呼！

20:09.124 --> 20:10.042
Ha!
哈!

20:10.125 --> 20:11.043
My recipe was...
我的食谱是...

20:11.126 --> 20:12.044
is...
是...

20:12.127 --> 20:14.588
and always will be the best.
并且永远是最好的。

20:14.671 --> 20:17.299
You wouldn't have that
recipe if it weren't for me!
你不会有那个
如果不是我的菜谱！

20:17.382 --> 20:18.675
You calling me a liar?
你骂我是骗子？

20:18.759 --> 20:21.094
Karen: Will you men stop
yelling at each other?
凯伦：你们能停下来吗
互相大喊大叫？

20:21.178 --> 20:26.099
I can't believe you let
a recipe ruin such a
wonderful friendship.
我不敢相信你让
一个食谱毁了这样一个
美好的友谊。

20:26.183 --> 20:30.395
You were my only true friend
that didn't have a president
printed on him.
你是我唯一真正的朋友
没有总统
印在他身上。

20:30.479 --> 20:32.731
But money doesn't talk back.
但钱是不会反驳的。

20:32.814 --> 20:38.403
My life has been nothing but a
long line of disappointment
since we became enemies.
我的生活只不过是
排长队失望
自从我们成为敌人。

20:38.487 --> 20:42.491
All these years, I've been
trying to steal your formula.
这些年来，我一直
试图窃取你的配方。

20:42.574 --> 20:47.120
But I was really just trying to
steal back our friendship.
但我真的只是想
偷回我们的友谊。

20:47.204 --> 20:48.830
Really?
真的吗？

20:48.914 --> 20:54.127
It's all I ever really
wanted, to get back to
the way it used to be.
这就是我曾经真正的一切
想要回到
就像以前那样。

20:54.211 --> 20:57.214
You and me against the world.
你我对抗世界。

20:57.297 --> 21:00.133
How about a hug, Krabs, old pal?
蟹蟹老朋友，拥抱一下怎么样？

21:00.217 --> 21:03.387
I'd like that, Planky, old chum.
我想要这个，普朗基，老朋友。

21:04.930 --> 21:07.391
Doesn't this warm
your heart, Karen?
这不暖和吗
你的心，凯伦？

21:07.474 --> 21:09.643
Karen: I suppose it would,
if I had one.
凯伦：我想会的，
如果我有的话。

21:09.726 --> 21:13.563
I'm sorry, Krabs old buddy.
对不起，蟹蟹老伙计。

21:13.647 --> 21:15.357
Mr. Krabs: Me too, me too...
蟹老板：我也是，我也是……

21:15.440 --> 21:17.275
Now, Karen.
现在，凯伦。

21:17.359 --> 21:19.778
Back off, rag boy.
退后吧，破布男孩。

21:22.364 --> 21:23.407
sabotage!
破坏！

21:23.490 --> 21:25.242
Go, Karen.
走吧，凯伦。

21:33.000 --> 21:35.627
Oh, that Plankton never learns,
does he, kids?
哦，浮游生物永远不会学习，
孩子们，他是吗？

21:35.711 --> 21:40.716
As for me, I decided
to take some time off
to catch up on me reading.
至于我，我决定
休息一段时间
赶上我的阅读进度。

21:40.799 --> 21:42.300
You didn't take time off.
你没有请假。

21:42.384 --> 21:43.593
You got fired.
你被解雇了。

21:43.677 --> 21:45.387
Hey, you got fired, too.
嘿，你也被解雇了。

21:45.470 --> 21:48.223
I got a golden parachute.
我有一个金色的降落伞。

21:52.185 --> 21:55.814
Well, at least I know they'll
never be able to replace me.
好吧，至少我知道他们会
永远无法取代我。

21:55.897 --> 22:00.027
looks like
they already did.
看起来像
他们已经这么做了。

22:00.110 --> 22:01.486
What?
什么？

22:01.570 --> 22:05.490
They let a smelly, hairy,
fleabag like that serve food?
他们让臭气熏天、毛茸茸的、
像这样的跳蚤提供食物吗？

22:07.284 --> 22:10.495
Hey, watch it, ape!
嘿，小心点，猿！

22:10.579 --> 22:13.165
Ooh, ow, ow....
噢噢噢……

22:13.248 --> 22:15.417
Watch the patch!
看补丁！

22:15.500 --> 22:18.503
Ow, no, please...
噢，不，请...

22:18.587 --> 22:19.838
I have a tomato allergy.
我对番茄过敏。

22:19.921 --> 22:20.589
Ow!
噢！

22:20.672 --> 22:21.548
Right in the buns.
就在面包里。

22:21.631 --> 22:25.260
Ow, ooh, ow!
噢，噢，噢！

22:25.343 --> 22:30.599
Man: And so, kids, always
remember to follow your dreams,
unless you're Patchy.
男人：所以，孩子们，永远
记得追随你的梦想，
除非你是帕奇。

22:30.682 --> 22:32.601
Then just stay in bed.
然后就躺在床上吧。

然后就躺在床上吧。